Allergy is reasonable as sneezing and runny nose are common symptoms of it. But, common cold is the perfect diagnosis which is surprisingly
made by Multinomial Naive Bayes. AdaBoost is a degenerate so it will be removed from the dictionary.


2. Patient reported symptoms : I have had a high fever since last night. My whole body aches.
Support Vector Machine : ['AIDS']
K-Nearest Neighbor : ['Allergy']
Logistic Regression : ['AIDS']
Gaussian Naive Bayes : ['Malaria']
Multinomial Naive Bayes : ['Common Cold']
Bernoulli Naive Bayes : ['AIDS']
Cat Boost : ['Common Cold']
Random Forest : ['Malaria']
