Allergy is the only unreasonable disease in here. The classifiers are not wrong for diagnosing AIDS or Malaria because fever and body ache 
do fall in the category of symptoms of both diseases. The symptoms are just too generic and broad enough to cover multiple diseases, even
common cold.
